OL,3,AGreens can move Labour in the right
OL,4,Adirection, says Polanski
OL,5,
OL,6,FZack Polanksi has urged voters to back
OL,7,Fthe Greens to force changes from Andy
OL,8,FBurnham, arguing his party has the
OL,9,Fpower to move Labour in "the right
OL,10,Fdirection".
OL,12,FIn his speech to the party's annual
OL,13,Fconference, the Green leader said that
OL,14,F"sustained pressure" from his party had
OL,15,Fmade forced Labour into changing its
OL,16,Fstance on issues including climate and
OL,17,Fits stance towards Israel.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
