OL,3,AGreens can move Labour in the right
OL,4,Adirection, says Polanski
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe told activists in Brighton that
OL,7,FLabour had failed to take action on
OL,8,Fhousing, as he called for a three-year
OL,9,Fcap to limit rent rises in the private
OL,10,Fsector.
OL,12,FAnd he said that voting for the Greens
OL,13,Fwould force changes from the
OL,14,Fgovernment, telling members: "Vote
OL,15,FGreen, and watch Labour move".
